    "Description": "DynamoDB Football Data Modeling Challenge #1 - Virtual Waiting Room. Single-table model: uniform-key absorb plane (FanEntry), sparse SequencingIndex GSI for background position assignment, singleton coordination items (ServingState, counters) on the EVT# partition. Eligibility is derived: queuePosition <= servingPosition. Sample data includes three fans in the same arrival bucket with different tiebreaks to show within-bucket lottery ordering.",
